Fight the Machine - License Information
========================================

This project consists of multiple components with different licenses:

1. FIGHT THE MACHINE WRAPPER/CONTAINER CODE
   License: Public Domain / Unlicense

   This is free and unencumbered software released into the public domain.
   Anyone is free to copy, modify, publish, use, compile, sell, or
   distribute this software, either in source code form or as a compiled
   binary, for any purpose, commercial or non-commercial, and by any means.

2. PSDOOM-NG GAME ENGINE
   License: GNU General Public License v2.0 (GPL-2.0)
   Repository: https://github.com/orsonteodoro/psdoom-ng

   Based on Chocolate Doom, which is also GPL-2.0 licensed.
   See: https://www.chocolate-doom.org/

3. DOOM SHAREWARE IWAD (doom1.wad) - release ZIP only, never in this repo
   License: Shareware, (c) id Software

   The release ZIP bundles the unmodified shareware doom1.wad (v1.9). It is
   freely distributable as shareware but remains the property of id
   Software; commercial use requires a licence from its owners. The game
   also runs on retail doom.wad / doom2.wad and on Freedoom - drop the file
   beside fightthemachine.exe.

4. PSDOOM LEVEL DATA (psdoom1.wad, psdoom2.wad)
   License: GPL-2.0, as distributed with psDoom
   Source: http://psdoom.sourceforge.net/

   Modified for this project: the TEXTURE1/TEXTURE2/PNAMES lumps were
   removed so the levels render against any IWAD, and psdoom1.wad's few
   registered-only textures and weapons were swapped for shareware ones.
   See patches/portable-psdoom-wad.py.

5. NOVNC (QEMU build only)
   License: MPL-2.0 (Mozilla Public License 2.0)
   Repository: https://github.com/novnc/noVNC

6. X11VNC (QEMU build only)
   License: GPL-2.0

